<title>USA: FAPRI sees 1.95 bln bu U.S. corn exports in 96/97.</title>
<headline>FAPRI sees 1.95 bln bu U.S. corn exports in 96/97.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. corn exports will total 1.95 billion bushles during the 1996-97 marketing year, the Food and Agricultural Policy Research Institute said Wednesday.</p>
<p>Its estimate matched the latest Agriculture Department figure. USDA will update its forecasts on Thursday at 0830 EST/1330 GMT.</p>
</text>
